1648
01:23:58,366 --> 01:24:01,202
¡Os queremos, Huntrix!

1649
01:24:01,286 --> 01:24:03,913
[música se desvanece]

1650
01:24:03,997 --> 01:24:06,124
Cómo os quiero, chicas.

1651
01:24:06,207 --> 01:24:09,711
- [clamor]
- [música alentadora]

1652
01:24:13,590 --> 01:24:15,592
[gritos de ovación]

1653
01:24:23,016 --> 01:24:25,018
[música se desvanece]

1654
01:24:25,101 --> 01:24:27,437
